                "title": "Solid Brass 3-1/2 Inch Heavy Duty Magnetic Door Stop",
                "description": "3-1/2 Inch Solid Brass Magnetic Door Stop, Deltana MDH35U3 - There are 2 main sections to the Magnetic door stop and holders. The 3-1/2 inch long base section has a permanent magnet on the end. It can vertically mount it to the floor or horizontally mount it to the wall or baseboard. The small receptor section is screwed to the door and is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. It is an extra strong magnet for big doors up to 10 feet tall. The heavy duty magnet make this door stop suitable for exterior or interior doors. Both sections of the magnetic door stop offer concealed screw mounting for an elegant installation. It comes packaged complete with mounting anchors and screws for easy installation. The Deltana heavy duty magnetic door stop is made of solid brass construction and available in 9 great finishes. Can also be used to hold open doors with Spring Door Hinges.",
